Version 1.05 BETA (October 1, 2026)
-----------------------------------
* Converted to native nftables for Arno's (NFT) Firewall (rules in table inet anf)
* Rules are no longer removed when stopping, (re)start and stop replace the whole ruleset atomically
* Banned hosts are elements of an nft set (instead of one rule per host)
* Reject as one icmpx rule for IPv4 and IPv6
! Status: the last banned host was printed without a newline
